    {
      "type": "overview",
      "id": "budget-variants",
      "title": "预算变体",
      "order": 130,
      "toc": true,
      "visible": true,
      "paragraphs": [
        "廉价终局是现实的开荒目标。昂贵版加暴击。Ward 堆叠与 Final Form 是高投入分支——Final Form 不是低预算构筑。"
      ],
      "bullets": []
    },
    {
      "type": "overview",
      "id": "defensive-layers",
      "title": "防御层",
      "order": 140,
      "toc": true,
      "visible": true,
      "paragraphs": [
        "Recoup 加 Energy Shield 是核心。Ward 在变体中叠加一层但不是无敌；保持满抗性，并警惕绕过 Recoup 的秒杀。"
      ],
      "bullets": []
    },
    {
      "type": "mapping",
      "id": "mapping",
      "title": "清图循环",
      "order": 150,
      "toc": true,
      "visible": true,
      "paragraphs": [
        "清图：让 Spark/Frostbolt 持续供给 CoC，保持 Recoup 覆盖并移动。触发调好后清图是自动的。"
      ],
      "bullets": []
    },
    {
      "type": "overview",
      "id": "rare-rotation",
      "title": "稀有怪循环",
      "order": 160,
      "toc": true,
      "visible": true,
      "paragraphs": [
        "稀有怪：确保暴击/能量使 Comet 触发；若卡住，检查单体配置，而非堆更多伤害宝石。"
      ],
      "bullets": []
    },
